      "Unseen complete prefix yields exact hard posterior; balanced repeated paths invent no extra information.",
      "Source/config SHA and split/count checks."
    ]
  },
  "limitations": [
    "No observations from saved candidate/validation games fit this classifier. Only their seed integers were read to exclude collisions.",
    "Own random-policy RNG is independent of DOS RNG, fixed by formation and reset per hypothesis. Its values are controlled, not a heldout axis.",
    "Exact-prefix support is100% in this synthetic dataset because of sampled deterministic source behavior. Coverage under our actual frozen native/teacher policy has not been measured and may be zero.",
    "Only DOSBlue after an actual ownRed move is modeled; DOSRed requires separately conditioned sequences.",
    "The procedural20% component and its probability after behavior are not estimated. A runtime method must retain robust support for non-template armies.",
    "No runtime DOS simulations, lookup, selectable policy, shared source, saved matches or production behavior changed."
  ],
  "next_review": "First independently audit the public-data/modeling boundary and investigate whether source-known template action separation occurs on actual frozen-policy public opening prefixes. Freeze any future classifier/model and run separate predictive calibration including procedural armies before discussing registered strength tests.",
